ement","s":"Brad Lukow","x":"Excluding the impact of the two store closures and severance cost, adjusted EBITDA increased 9% in the fourth quarter to $69 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/22/sprouts-farmers-markets-sfm-q4-2018-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"SFM 2019 Q1","e":"sfm","d":"2019-05-02","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Bradley S. Lukow","x":"It's more of a theater with all the service from within a rectangular island within the store.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/sprouts-farmers-market-inc-sfm-q1-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SFM 2019 Q1","e":"sfm","d":"2019-05-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bradley S. Lukow","x":"For the quarter, we experienced cost inflation, predominantly driven by adverse weather conditions causing periods of significant spikes in the cost of certain produce items that we were not able to fully pass through in retail pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/sprouts-farmers-market-inc-sfm-q1-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SFM 2019 Q1","e":"sfm","d":"2019-05-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bradley S. Lukow","x":"On the non-perishable side of the business, we started to see some pass through of the cost increases that we experienced in late Q4 and into the first half of Q1.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/sprouts-farmers-market-inc-sfm-q1-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SFM 2019 Q1","e":"sfm","d":"2019-05-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bradley S. Lukow","x":"Also, we recently implemented workday financials, which will streamline our finance processes, integrate with our operational systems and provide timely, actionable, financial information throughout the store network.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/sprouts-farmers-market-inc-sfm-q1-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SFM 2019 Q2","e":"sfm","d":"2019-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jack L. Sinclair","x":"There's no reason why we need to be not able to pass-through margins as cost prices change.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/sprouts-farmers-market-inc-sfm-q2-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SFM 2019 Q2","e":"sfm","d":"2019-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Chuck Cerankosky","x":"Similar to what Scott was getting at when you're looking at the food retailing environment right now, can you tell us why you think it's so difficult to pass-through higher food costs while consumers are saying expanded discretionary income?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/sprouts-farmers-market-inc-sfm-q2-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SFM 2019 Q3","e":"sfm","d":"2019-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lawrence P. Molloy","x":"Store closure and other cause mainly related to executive severance and hurricane preparedness, were $2 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/sprouts-farmers-market-inc-sfm-q3-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SFM 2019 Q3","e":"sfm","d":"2019-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jack Sinclair","x":"We plan to build a cohesive private label brand streamlining and improving our communication to customers that maximize the Sprouts position as the affordable healthy living grocer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/sprouts-farmers-market-inc-sfm-q3-2019-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SFM 2020 Q1","e":"sfm","d":"2020-05-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jack Sinclair","x":"We've adapted our marketing spend to focus on customer acquisition and communication through more digital, social and streaming radio with the message to stay connected with us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/sprouts-farmers-market-inc-sfm-q1-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SFM 2020 Q1","e":"sfm","d":"2020-05-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jack Sinclair","x":"This work will progress, eventually flipping a much larger portion of our marketing spend to various paid campaigns in social, search, streaming medias and more, which can build top-of-mind awareness of Sprouts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/sprouts-farmers-market-inc-sfm-q1-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SFM 2020 Q1","e":"sfm","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Denise Paulonis","x":"In summary, strong unit returns and ample market opportunity, coupled with low single-digit comparable sales growth, smarter promotions and other cost-savings activities, can lead to a stabilization and potential expansion of our EBIT margins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/sprouts-farmers-market-inc-sfm-q1-2020-earnings-ca.aspx"},{"c":"SFM 2020 Q4","e":"sfm","d":"2021-02-25","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Jack Sinclair","x":"Our marketing now spans a diverse mix of high affinity TV, radio and streaming to help build brand awareness and accelerate the reach of our message.More personal digital touch points, like location-based shopping behavior, social media profiles and contextual targeting will help to drive…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/26/sprouts-farmers-market-inc-sfm-q4-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SFM 2020 Q4","e":"sfm","d":"2021-02-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Rupesh Parikh","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/26/sprouts-farmers-market-inc-sfm-q4-2020-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SFM 2021 Q1","e":"sfm","d":"2021-05-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jack Sinclair","x":"But what we're hearing so far and what's in front of us, we're feeling that we can pass it on and not have the kind of huge worry about what might happen going forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/sprouts-farmers-market-inc-sfm-q1-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SFM 2021 Q1","e":"sfm","d":"2021-05-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Carden","x":"But how are you thinking about inflation over the course of the next few months, and as your new promotional strategy really change your thought process with respect to passing-through any higher costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/sprouts-farmers-market-inc-sfm-q1-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SFM 2021 Q2","e":"sfm","d":"2021-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Spencer Hanus","x":"Yeah, that's really helpful color and then I just wanted to ask on inflation, what was that running in the second quarter and, and how are you thinking about through the passing that through sort of over the next, in the back half and then into 2022?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/sprouts-farmers-market-inc-sfm-q2-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SFM 2021 Q2","e":"sfm","d":"2021-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jack Sinclair","x":"…pretty flat in terms of we're not seeing huge problems passing on our price, the pricing changes in produce, the protein side of things, salmon and beef and we have seen significant cost price increases, and we probably haven't been able to pass on quite as much as we'd like to, but we do see.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/sprouts-farmers-market-inc-sfm-q2-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SFM 2021 Q3","e":"sfm","d":"2021-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jack Sinclair","x":"We continually monitor market price points in all departments and are able to pass-through most but not all cost increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/05/sprouts-farmers-market-inc-sfm-q3-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SFM 2021 Q3","e":"sfm","d":"2021-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jack Sinclair","x":"That said we are experiencing higher costs, most of which we're passing through outside of some fresh categories.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/05/sprouts-farmers-market-inc-sfm-q3-2021-earnings-ca/"},{"c":"SFM 2024 Q3","e":"sfm","d":"2024-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Ken Goldman","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/sprouts-sfm-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SFM 2024 Q3","e":"sfm","d":"2024-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Curtis Valentine","x":"The better we get at that, the lower that -- if we can take cost out, we can take parts of the process out, some of the inefficiency there, we can build them faster, cheaper and as the interest rates come down, the economics improve there as well and that allows us to go faster.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/sprouts-sfm-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SFM 2025 Q3","e":"sfm","d":"2025-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Scott Michael Marks","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/30/sprouts-sfm-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SFM 2026 Q1","e":"sfm","d":"2026-04-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jack Sinclair","x":"Tariffs put some pressure on the top-line prices of a number of categories, and that has eased off a little bit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/sprouts-sfm-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SFM 2026 Q1","e":"sfm","d":"2026-04-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Curtis Valentine","x":"For the full year, on a 52-week basis, we are maintaining our outlook for total sales growth between 4.5% to 6.5% and comp sales between negative 1% to positive 1%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/sprouts-sfm-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SFM 2026 Q3","e":"sfm","d":"2026-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Nick Konat","x":"Over time, we believe stronger sales performance, together with expanded self-distribution, improved retail media, vendor p